## Key Concepts

- IaC and manifest static analysis with OpenAI prompts
- Versioned KB in Azure Blob + Cognitive Search queries
- Per-tenant RBAC via Azure AD
- Automated remediation guidance and risk scoring
- Auditable run logs stored in Data Lake and surfaced in PR checks

## Code Example

```javascript
// Node-like pseudocode: extractFiles -> prompt -> OpenAI -> outputRemediation()
async function auditFiles(files, kbVersion) {
  const insights = await openai.promptAnalyze({ files, kbVersion });
  const remediations = generateRemediation(insights);
  await storeAuditLog({ files, remediations, kbVersion });
  return remediations;
